                            Sarasota-Bradenton, FL</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p class="footer-heading">Company</p>
                    <a class="footer-link" href="#welcome">About Us</a>
                    <a class="footer-link" href="/properties/">Our Properties</a>
                    <a class="footer-link" href="/property-management/">For Owners</a>
                    <a class="footer-link" href="#contact">Contact</a>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p class="footer-heading">Support</p>
                    <span class="footer-link" onclick="openLegalModal('support')">FAQs</span>
                    <span class="footer-link" onclick="openLegalModal('terms')">Booking Policy</span>
                    <span class="footer-link" onclick="openLegalModal('terms')">Cancellation</span>
                    <span class="footer-link" onclick="openLegalModal('support')">Guest Guide</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p class="footer-heading">Legal</p>
                    <span class="footer-link" onclick="openLegalModal('privacy')">Privacy Policy</span>
                    <span class="footer-link" onclick="openLegalModal('terms')">Terms of Service</span>
                    <span class="footer-link" onclick="openLegalModal('cookies')">Cookie Policy</span>
